    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of being the villain in a Tower Defense? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the one who sends waves and waves of troops to break through the enemy defenses in this Reverse Tower Defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon, conquer and upgrade your troops to dominate the whole world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/7a9b5db7390753a898e6e0c9f39070dd.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Choose the troops, the order and the path you\u2019ll send in each wave. Think of your strategies to conquer each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.webm?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.mp4?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/b1decbe8a7848114d7e2934d6bd3019d.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Play through the kingdoms, each with their own features. Plains, forest, coast, wasteland, snowed mountains and desert, conquer everything on your own time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.webm?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.mp4?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/5e8694ed12bb59d6934290a931806c36.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Unlock units, choose their profession, upgrade the stats and change their skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/80b767365d384b547e35c06e3da077ba.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/80b767365d384b547e35c06e3da077ba.gif?t=1753777041\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/87e695bba2c319004d738b9777f70c95.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Dominate each state of the region, advance without rest with your troops to conquer the whole world. But take care, the states can rebel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/1d113f87827f13b4c9eb5f170ff882a8.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/1d113f87827f13b4c9eb5f170ff882a8.gif?t=1753777041\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Kingdoms with 52 maps total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Enemy defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Troops to unlock, each with 2 different professions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many skins to each troop to use at your own liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Spells to help the units through the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skilltree with more than 50 unlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing climate, rain, clouds, storm, mist\u2026 you can face many of them in your conquest.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of being the villain in a Tower Defense? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the one who sends waves and waves of troops to break through the enemy defenses in this Reverse Tower Defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon, conquer and upgrade your troops to dominate the whole world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/7a9b5db7390753a898e6e0c9f39070dd.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Choose the troops, the order and the path you\u2019ll send in each wave. Think of your strategies to conquer each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.webm?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.mp4?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/b1decbe8a7848114d7e2934d6bd3019d.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Play through the kingdoms, each with their own features. Plains, forest, coast, wasteland, snowed mountains and desert, conquer everything on your own time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.webm?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.mp4?t=1753777041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/5e8694ed12bb59d6934290a931806c36.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Unlock units, choose their profession, upgrade the stats and change their skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/80b767365d384b547e35c06e3da077ba.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/80b767365d384b547e35c06e3da077ba.gif?t=1753777041\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/87e695bba2c319004d738b9777f70c95.avif?t=1753777041\" /></span>Dominate each state of the region, advance without rest with your troops to conquer the whole world. But take care, the states can rebel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/1d113f87827f13b4c9eb5f170ff882a8.poster.avif?t=1753777041\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/1d113f87827f13b4c9eb5f170ff882a8.gif?t=1753777041\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Kingdoms with 52 maps total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Enemy defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Troops to unlock, each with 2 different professions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many skins to each troop to use at your own liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Spells to help the units through the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skilltree with more than 50 unlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing climate, rain, clouds, storm, mist\u2026 you can face many of them in your conquest.</p></li></ul>",
